  "display_title": "The Devilishly Trash Duke",
  "description": "After a fatal tragedy, our heroine wakes up as Aurora, a character from a novel she once read. While coming to grips with her new reality, she’s sent to marry the Duke of Ettica, a.k.a. infamous piece of trash. This trash duke knows no bounds! \n\n*\"Could you punch me right now?\"* Not only is he a scumbag, he's a perv too?! \n\n*\"If I end up falling for you, I will become your loyal little dog.\"* What has Aurora gotten herself into? \n\nPerhaps it’s the start of a puppy love…? Or perhaps it’s leading to something more… \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS) \n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
